    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this huge painful red bump on my upper back. it feels really tight like its full of liquid and it's throbbing a bit. i was thinking about just taking a needle, cleaning it with alcohol, and poking it to drain the pressure so it heals faster. is that okay to do at home or should i be worried?",
